{"seq":3,"slug":"compliance-as-code","title":"合规即代码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks/compliance-as-code","wordCount":1431,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"合规即代码\">合规即代码</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>合规即代码（Compliance as Code, CaC）是将合规要求编码为可执行的策略规则，通过自动化工具持续验证云基础设施和应用的合规状态。传统的合规管理依赖人工检查和定期审计，周期长、成本高、覆盖面有限。CaC 将合规检查嵌入到 CI/CD 管道和运行时环境中，实现实时、持续、全覆盖的合规验证。</p>\n<p>CaC 的核心理念是&quot;策略即代码&quot;（Policy as Code）——安全策略不再是 Word 文档中的文字描述，而是可以被版本控制、测试、部署和自动执行的代码。当基础设施变更违反策略时，系统自动阻止部署或触发修复。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 传统合规&#10;        A[安全策略文档] --&gt; B[人工检查]&#10;        B --&gt; C[季度审计]&#10;        C --&gt; D[审计报告]&#10;        D --&gt; E[人工修复]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 合规即代码&#10;        F[策略代码] --&gt; G[CI/CD集成]&#10;        G --&gt; H[自动检测]&#10;        H --&gt; I[实时告警]&#10;        I --&gt; J[自动修复]&#10;        J --&gt; K[持续合规仪表板]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 传统合规\n        A[安全策略文档] --&gt; B[人工检查]\n        B --&gt; C[季度审计]\n        C --&gt; D[审计报告]\n        D --&gt; E[人工修复]\n    end\n    subgraph 合规即代码\n        F[策略代码] --&gt; G[CI/CD集成]\n        G --&gt; H[自动检测]\n        H --&gt; I[实时告警]\n        I --&gt; J[自动修复]\n        J --&gt; K[持续合规仪表板]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>传统合规</th>\n<th>合规即代码</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>检测频率</td>\n<td>季度/年度</td>\n<td>实时/持续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖范围</td>\n<td>抽样检查</td>\n<td>全量扫描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应时间</td>\n<td>天-周级</td>\n<td>秒-分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>依赖人员经验</td>\n<td>规则确定性执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可追溯性</td>\n<td>文档记录</td>\n<td>版本控制 + 审计日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>高（人工密集）</td>\n<td>低（自动化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>误报率</td>\n<td>高（主观判断）</td>\n<td>低（规则精确）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"aws-config-与合规规则\">AWS Config 与合规规则</h2><p>AWS Config 是 AWS 原生的配置审计和合规评估服务。Config 持续记录 AWS 资源的配置变更，并通过 Config Rules 评估资源配置是否符合预定义的安全基线。</p>\n<p><strong>Config Rules 类型</strong>：</p>\n<p><strong>AWS 托管规则</strong>：AWS 预建的 300+ 条合规规则，覆盖 IAM、S3、EC2、RDS、Lambda 等常见服务的安全最佳实践。开箱即用，无需编写代码。</p>\n<p><strong>自定义规则</strong>：使用 Lambda 函数实现组织特定的合规检查。当资源配置变更时触发 Lambda 函数评估，返回 COMPLIANT 或 NON_COMPLIANT。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import type { ConfigServiceClient } from &#39;@aws-sdk/client-config-service&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface ConfigEvent {&#10;  invokingEvent: string;&#10;  ruleParameters: string;&#10;  resultToken: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ConfigurationItem {&#10;  resourceType: string;&#10;  resourceId: string;&#10;  configuration: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;export const handler = async (event: ConfigEvent) =&gt; {&#10;  const invokingEvent = JSON.parse(event.invokingEvent);&#10;  const configItem: ConfigurationItem = invokingEvent.configurationItem;&#10;&#10;  let compliance = &#39;COMPLIANT&#39;;&#10;&#10;  if (configItem.resourceType === &#39;AWS::S3::Bucket&#39;) {&#10;    const encryption = configItem.configuration.serverSideEncryptionConfiguration;&#10;    if (!encryption) {&#10;      compliance = &#39;NON_COMPLIANT&#39;;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    compliance,&#10;    annotation: compliance === &#39;NON_COMPLIANT&#39; ? &#39;S3 bucket does not have encryption enabled&#39; : undefined,&#10;  };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ConfigServiceClient } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@aws-sdk/client-config-service'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConfigEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  invokingEvent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  ruleParameters</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  resultToken</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConfigurationItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  resourceType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  resourceId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  configuration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConfigEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> invokingEvent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.invokingEvent);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> configItem</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConfigurationItem</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> invokingEvent.configurationItem;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> compliance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'COMPLIANT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (configItem.resourceType </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'AWS::S3::Bucket'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> encryption</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> configItem.configuration.serverSideEncryptionConfiguration;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">encryption) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      compliance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'NON_COMPLIANT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    compliance,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    annotation: compliance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'NON_COMPLIANT'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'S3 bucket does not have encryption enabled'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Conformance Pack</strong> 是 Config Rules 的集合，映射到特定的合规框架。AWS 提供预建的 Conformance Pack：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Conformance Pack</th>\n<th>包含规则数</th>\n<th>覆盖框架</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CIS AWS Foundations Benchmark</td>\n<td>49</td>\n<td>CIS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PCI DSS v3.2.1</td>\n<td>31</td>\n<td>PCI DSS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AWS Foundational Security</td>\n<td>50+</td>\n<td>AWS 安全最佳实践</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NIST 800-53</td>\n<td>60+</td>\n<td>NIST</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HIPAA Security</td>\n<td>25</td>\n<td>HIPAA</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>自动修复</strong>：Config Rules 检测到不合规资源后，可以通过 SSM Automation 自动修复。例如：检测到未加密的 EBS 卷 → 自动创建快照 → 从快照创建加密卷 → 替换原卷。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Config Rule检测] --&gt; B{合规?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[COMPLIANT]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[NON_COMPLIANT]&#10;    D --&gt; E[SSM Automation]&#10;    E --&gt; F[自动修复]&#10;    F --&gt; G[重新评估]&#10;    G --&gt; C\">graph LR\n    A[Config Rule检测] --&gt; B{合规?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[COMPLIANT]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[NON_COMPLIANT]\n    D --&gt; E[SSM Automation]\n    E --&gt; F[自动修复]\n    F --&gt; G[重新评估]\n    G --&gt; C</pre><h2 id=\"open-policy-agent-与策略引擎\">Open Policy Agent 与策略引擎</h2><p>Open Policy Agent（OPA）是 CNCF 毕业项目，提供通用的策略引擎。OPA 使用 Rego 语言编写策略，可以评估任意结构化数据（JSON/YAML）。在云安全领域，OPA 用于 IaC 安全扫描、Kubernetes 准入控制和 API 授权。</p>\n<p><strong>Rego 策略语言</strong>示例——检查 Terraform 配置中 S3 桶是否启用加密：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"package terraform.s3&#10;&#10;deny[msg] {&#10;    resource := input.resource.aws_s3_bucket[name]&#10;    not resource.server_side_encryption_configuration&#10;    msg := sprintf(&quot;S3 bucket &#39;%s&#39; must have encryption enabled&quot;, [name])&#10;}&#10;&#10;deny[msg] {&#10;    resource := input.resource.aws_s3_bucket[name]&#10;    not resource.versioning[_].enabled == true&#10;    msg := sprintf(&quot;S3 bucket &#39;%s&#39; must have versioning enabled&quot;, [name])&#10;}&#10;&#10;deny[msg] {&#10;    resource := input.resource.aws_s3_bucket[name]&#10;    resource.acl == &quot;public-read&quot;&#10;    msg := sprintf(&quot;S3 bucket &#39;%s&#39; must not be publicly readable&quot;, [name])&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>package terraform.s3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>deny[msg] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    resource := input.resource.aws_s3_bucket[name]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    not resource.server_side_encryption_configuration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msg := sprintf(\"S3 bucket '%s' must have encryption enabled\", [name])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>deny[msg] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    resource := input.resource.aws_s3_bucket[name]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    not resource.versioning[_].enabled == true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msg := sprintf(\"S3 bucket '%s' must have versioning enabled\", [name])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>deny[msg] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    resource := input.resource.aws_s3_bucket[name]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    resource.acl == \"public-read\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msg := sprintf(\"S3 bucket '%s' must not be publicly readable\", [name])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Kubernetes 准入控制</strong>：OPA Gatekeeper 作为 Kubernetes 的准入 Webhook，在资源创建/更新时评估策略。拒绝不合规的资源（如使用 latest 标签的容器、未设置资源限制的 Pod、以 root 运行的容器）。</p>\n<p><strong>Conftest</strong> 是 OPA 的 CLI 工具，将策略检查集成到 CI/CD 管道：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>策略语言</th>\n<th>集成方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AWS Config</td>\n<td>无代码/Lambda</td>\n<td>AWS 原生</td>\n<td>AWS 资源合规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OPA/Conftest</td>\n<td>Rego</td>\n<td>CLI/API</td>\n<td>IaC 扫描、K8s 准入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Checkov</td>\n<td>Python (内置规则)</td>\n<td>CLI</td>\n<td>Terraform/CloudFormation</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tfsec</td>\n<td>Go (内置规则)</td>\n<td>CLI</td>\n<td>Terraform 专用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sentinel</td>\n<td>Sentinel</td>\n<td>Terraform Cloud</td>\n<td>HashiCorp 生态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"iac-安全扫描\">IaC 安全扫描</h2><p>Infrastructure as Code（IaC）安全扫描在基础设施部署之前检测安全配置错误。这是&quot;安全左移&quot;（Shift Left）的核心实践——在代码阶段而非运行时发现问题，修复成本最低。</p>\n<p><strong>Checkov</strong> 是最流行的 IaC 安全扫描工具，支持 Terraform、CloudFormation、Kubernetes、Dockerfile 和 Serverless Framework。内置 1000+ 检查规则，覆盖 AWS、Azure、GCP 的安全最佳实践。</p>\n<p><strong>CI/CD 集成示例</strong>（GitHub Actions）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Security Scan&#10;on: [pull_request]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  iac-scan:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - name: Run Checkov&#10;        uses: bridgecrewio/checkov-action@v12&#10;        with:&#10;          directory: terraform/&#10;          framework: terraform&#10;          soft_fail: false&#10;          output_format: sarif&#10;&#10;      - name: Run tfsec&#10;        uses: aquasecurity/tfsec-action@v1&#10;        with:&#10;          working_directory: terraform/&#10;          soft_fail: false&#10;&#10;      - name: Run Trivy Config&#10;        uses: aquasecurity/trivy-action@master&#10;        with:&#10;          scan-type: config&#10;          scan-ref: terraform/&#10;          exit-code: 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Security Scan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  iac-scan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run Checkov</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">bridgecrewio/checkov-action@v12</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          directory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">terraform/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          framework</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">terraform</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          soft_fail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          output_format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">sarif</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run tfsec</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">aquasecurity/tfsec-action@v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          working_directory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">terraform/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          soft_fail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run Trivy Config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">aquasecurity/trivy-action@master</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          scan-type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          scan-ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">terraform/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          exit-code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>扫描覆盖矩阵</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查项</th>\n<th>Checkov</th>\n<th>tfsec</th>\n<th>Trivy</th>\n<th>OPA/Conftest</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>S3 公开访问</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>自定义规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全组全开</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>自定义规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未加密存储</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>自定义规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IAM 过宽权限</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>自定义规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容器镜像漏洞</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义规则</td>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td>YAML</td>\n<td>Rego</td>\n<td>Rego</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"持续合规监控\">持续合规监控</h2><p>合规不是一次性的项目，而是持续的过程。持续合规监控确保基础设施在整个生命周期中保持合规状态。</p>\n<p><strong>AWS Security Hub</strong> 是安全态势的集中视图。它聚合来自 GuardDuty、Inspector、Macie、Config、Firewall Manager 等服务的安全发现。内置安全标准（CIS AWS Foundations、AWS Foundational Security Best Practices、PCI DSS）提供合规分数和趋势。</p>\n<p><strong>合规仪表板设计</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 数据源&#10;        A[Config Rules]&#10;        B[Security Hub]&#10;        C[GuardDuty]&#10;        D[Inspector]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 聚合层&#10;        E[Security Hub]&#10;        F[EventBridge]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 展示层&#10;        G[Grafana Dashboard]&#10;        H[QuickSight Report]&#10;        I[Slack/PagerDuty]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; E&#10;    B --&gt; E&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; I\">graph TB\n    subgraph 数据源\n        A[Config Rules]\n        B[Security Hub]\n        C[GuardDuty]\n        D[Inspector]\n    end\n    subgraph 聚合层\n        E[Security Hub]\n        F[EventBridge]\n    end\n    subgraph 展示层\n        G[Grafana Dashboard]\n        H[QuickSight Report]\n        I[Slack/PagerDuty]\n    end\n    A --&gt; E\n    B --&gt; E\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; I</pre><p><strong>合规度量指标</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>目标值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>合规率</td>\n<td>合规资源数 / 总资源数</td>\n<td>&gt;99%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均修复时间（MTTR）</td>\n<td>从检测到修复的平均时间</td>\n<td>&lt;24 小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键发现数</td>\n<td>高严重性未解决的发现</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全覆盖率</td>\n<td>启用安全服务的账户比例</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漂移率</td>\n<td>从合规变为不合规的资源比例</td>\n<td>&lt;1%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>GitOps 合规流程</strong>：将合规策略存储在 Git 仓库中，通过 Pull Request 审批策略变更。CI/CD 管道自动部署策略到 Config Rules / OPA / Gatekeeper。任何策略变更都有完整的审计追踪（Git 历史 + PR 审批记录）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>合规即代码将安全策略编码为可自动执行的规则，实现实时持续合规</li>\n<li>AWS Config + Conformance Pack 提供 AWS 原生的合规评估和自动修复</li>\n<li>OPA/Rego 是通用策略引擎，支持 IaC 扫描和 Kubernetes 准入控制</li>\n<li>Checkov/tfsec 在 CI/CD 中扫描 IaC 配置，阻止不安全的部署</li>\n<li>Security Hub 聚合安全发现，提供 CIS/PCI DSS 合规分数</li>\n<li>合规度量：合规率 &gt;99%、MTTR &lt;24h、关键发现数 = 0</li>\n<li>GitOps 合规流程：策略版本控制 + PR 审批 + 自动部署 + 审计追踪</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"合规即代码","id":"合规即代码"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"AWS Config 与合规规则","id":"aws-config-与合规规则"},{"level":2,"text":"Open Policy Agent 与策略引擎","id":"open-policy-agent-与策略引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"IaC 安全扫描","id":"iac-安全扫描"},{"level":2,"text":"持续合规监控","id":"持续合规监控"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"审计日志","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks/audit-logging"},"next":{"title":"安全审计与日志","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks/security-audit"}}